{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02523","headline":"赋终南山用风字韵应诏 · 杨师道","name":"赋终南山用风字韵应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"眷言怀隐逸，辍驾践幽丛。\n白云飞夏雨，碧岭横春虹。\n草绿长杨路，花疎五柞宫。\n登临日将晚，兰桂起香风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨师道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02523.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02523","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}